    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>The risk: why is this a "lottery"?</h2>
    <p>Crafting is a genuine gamble. A failed attempt <strong>destroys every gift you put in</strong>, with no refund and no partial compensation. Telegram describes this openly as a risk-based mechanic, so only feed in gifts that are low-value or that you're genuinely willing to lose — think carefully before risking anything rare or expensive.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Crafting vs. Upgrade — what's the difference?</h2>
    <div class="post-table-wrap">
